; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 21. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'st68_neil'
st68_neil.dialogstring_06AB53! `[DEF]Three days have passed[N]since Will and the others[N]entered the undersea[N]tunnel.[FIN][DEF]The passages are lit by[N]strange mushrooms... or,[N]as Neil calls them,[N]"bioluminescent fungi."[FIN][DEF]According to Neil, the sea[N]above is unusually[N]shallow, with Mu resting[N]on an underwater plateau[FIN][DEF]only a few miles off[N]shore.[FIN][CLD][PAU:28][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Let's stop here for[N]today.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Good! My legs aren't[N]as long as yours, and we[N]must have walked a[N]thousand miles today.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: A thousand miles?[N]Nobody walks that far[N]in a day.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I can't stand this![N]This whole journey has[N]been one exhausting thing[N]after another![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: We all feel that[N]way, so save your breath.[N]More importantly, I'm[N]hungry. Let's eat.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_erik'
st68_erik.dialogstring_06AE70! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I gotta pee! Give me[N]some space.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_lance'
st68_lance.dialogstring_06AF03! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: How the heck long[N]does this tunnel go on[AD]?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_neil'
st68_neil.dialogstring_06ACB9! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: People must have[N]walked this tunnel[N]thousands of years ago.[WAI][N]It's strange. Knowing they[N]stood where we stand makes[N]them feel less distant.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_lily'
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B57D! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: It's strange what[N]people can endure when[N]they have no choice.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]You lose track of time,[N]the darkness gets to you,[N]and even your friends[N]start driving you crazy.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Then you realize they're[N]the only thing keeping you[N]sane.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Maybe that's how the[N]people who dug this tunnel[N]got through it.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_kara'
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B069! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Aah, I want to eat[N]a steak…! I want to eat a[N]salad…!![FIN]My skin is already turning[N]dry because we're only[N]eating weird things…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_mushrooms'
st68_mushrooms.dialogstring_06B86E! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Mushrooms for light.[N]Mushrooms for food.[WAI][N]I don't care if I'm[N]talking to myself.[FIN]At least I won't snap at[N]myself for being tired[N]and hungry...[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_kara'
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B0BC! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Oh gosh. Will found[N]mushrooms again…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You have to think[N]of it as being better than[N]starving to death.[N]Alright, let's eat…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_erik'
st68_erik.dialogstring_06AE88! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Another day drags by…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_lily'
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B606! `[DEF]The sixth day in the[N]tunnel.[FIN][DEF]Unable to sleep, Will[N]watches the underground[N]stream in the darkness.[END]`
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B661! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Can't sleep?[END]`
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B67B! `[PAU:1E][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Yeah. I'm hungry.[N][PAU:28][AD]I'm kidding.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You know, Will,[N]we've all changed since we[N]left home.[WAI][N]Maybe journeys make people[N]grow whether they mean to[N]or not.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: My change is a[N]little more literal.[N]You've seen me become[N]that warrior.[WAI][N]I think something happened[N]to me at the Tower of[N]Babel. I think the comet[N]may be part of it.[WAI][N]Sometimes, as Freedan,[N]I remember things that[N]never happened to me.[WAI][N]Battles. Faces. Places[N]I've never seen.[WAI][N]When I change back, it[N]fades, like waking from[N]someone else's dream.[WAI][N]Sometimes I worry that if[N]I stay as Freedan for too[N]long... that I might lose[N][PAU:18]myself.[WAI][N]I don't understand[N]why. But I think this[N]journey is leading me[N]to the answer.[WAI][N]What about you, Lilly?[N]Why did you come this far?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I told myself[N]we were discovering[N]history... maybe even[N]making it.[WAI][N]I think that after being[N]saved by Lance... and you,[N]enough times...[WAI][N]I think somewhere we[N]became family, and not[N]just friends. I even think[N]of Kara as a sister now.[WAI][N]But don't you DARE[N]tell her that![WAI][N]We have another long day[N]tomorrow. I'm going to[N]sleep.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_neil'
st68_neil.dialogstring_06AD22! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Nearly two weeks in the[N]tunnel, and still no sign[N]of an exit…[END]`
st68_neil.dialogstring_06AD64! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hey, did anyone[N]else hear those creepy[N]sounds above us last[N]night?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Ya hear every[N]little thing when you're[N]tired. It was probably[N]nothin'.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I heard them.[N]Sounded like far away[N]drums.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I miss music.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: I miss Hamlet.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Who's Hamlet?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: My pet pig.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Ah...[N]I do miss bacon,[N]especially crisp and-[FIN][CLD][BOR:2][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Finish that[N]sentence and I'll eat you[N]first![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Sorry.[N][PAU:1E]...But you did name it[N][SFX:A]Ham-let.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Neil!![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I hear pigs are[N]good at sniffing out[N]truffles.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Have you ever had[N]truffles?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: No, why?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: They're a lot like[N]mushrooms.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Ehhh... never mind,[N]I would rather-[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hold on![END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_kara'
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B10B! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Listen… You can[N]hear it even now…! I[N]wonder what it is… That[N]sound…[END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B13C! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Is the tunnel caving[N]in?![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: This is bad[AD]!![N]Run!![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Run where!? We're[N]in a tunnel![END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B195! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Everyone, quiet![N]Listen to that repeating[N]vibration.[WAI][N]It's Morse code.[WAI][N]Ships use short and long[N]signals to represent[N]words.[WAI][N]I think I can decode it.[N]Give me a moment.[END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B250! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5][DLY:4]I'm Seth[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Lance: Seth?![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:0]Lilly: Shh. Let Neil hear[N]the rest.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5][DLY:4]A great sea beast[N]swallowed me.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5][DLY:4]When I woke, my body had[N]become like theirs.[FIN]The others here say they[N]aren't monsters, just[N]another form of life[N]shaped for the sea.[FIN]They say the comet's[N]light pushes living things[N]toward new forms.[FIN]Some call that corruption.[N]Others call it evolution.[N]Characteristically, I[N]still don't know the word.[FIN]I can breathe here.[N]I am still myself.[FIN]I wish I could rejoin you,[N]but this body has another[N]road now.[FIN]Find the truth about the[N]comet and the ruins[N]for me.[END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B3EC! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: The signal stopped.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Poor Seth[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Seth learned Morse[N]code too, huh? Guess all[N]those books paid off.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: But he's not even[N]human anymore![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: I wouldn't say that.[N]We call the human body[N]the best one because it[N]is the body we know.[WAI][N]If Seth can think, choose,[N]and care about us, maybe[N]his shape isn't the part[N]that matters most.[WAI][N]Come on. We still have a[N]long road ahead.[END]`
